<title>UK: London tea sale average price.</title>
<headline>London tea sale average price.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The weighted average for the 8,578 packages of landed tea sold at this weeks London sale was 123.78 pence a kilo against 118.78 last week and 102.74 a year ago.</p>
<p>The average for the 215,302 pkgs sold so far this year is 112.24 pence against 100.64 pence for the 314,587 pkgs sold by this stage last year.</p>
